| riscos-mesa VideoOverlay test T1: which overlay formats and sizes this
| machine offers. Takes a few seconds. Results are added to "ovlresults" in
| this directory.
Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure VideoOverlay 0.00 IfThere System:Modules.VideoOverlay Then RMLoad System:Modules.VideoOverlay
| ELF programs need the slot set before they start, whatever the Next slot is
WimpSlot -min 16000K
Run ovltest vet
